(1) & =⟨{3}^{1-1},\\,{log}_{3}⁡({1}^{2}+2(1)),\\,{sec}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,{log}_{3}⁡(3),\\,{(\\sqrt{2})}^{2}-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,1,\\,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186575603 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068857 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "d59ccd52-63db-5d28-b78b-2df7caf52ad0" :knowledge-point/title "Evaluating a Vector-Valued Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c0b8a997-53b4-5393-909f-60b1d1a31202" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575293}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c0b8a997-53b4-5393-909f-60b1d1a31202" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575293} :answer-field/id #uuid "1ef9f099-cf6a-5618-b6ca-bd725a54e014" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575423} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d82ae491-f8e2-5c02-bd25-c5e05ebe5d23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575337}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d82ae491-f8e2-5c02-bd25-c5e05ebe5d23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575337} :answer-field/id #uuid "9defb5a0-7cc3-5a35-a9d3-cb0b1146444b" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575477}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "d0d01a34-dbf9-5949-a688-edf940f34604" :question/math-academy-id "q-348676" :question/problem "Given that $r(t)=⟨{t}^{2}-21,\\,\\sqrt{3t-9}⟩,$ calculate $r(6).$\n\n$r(6)=⟨$\n{{field-1}} $,$\n\n{{field-2}}$⟩$" :question/worked-solution "We substitute $t=6$ into our function, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(6) & =⟨{6}^{2}-21,\\,\\sqrt{3\\cdot 6-9}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨36-21,\\,\\sqrt{9}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨15,\\,3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186575615 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068858 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e520dc67-3b63-5ca7-959b-f642d85529d6" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Magnitude of a Vector-Valued Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "30dfc837-d5c1-5761-8aca-09d8e183f2c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575033}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "30dfc837-d5c1-5761-8aca-09d8e183f2c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575033} :answer-field/id #uuid "b8dd47c6-0daf-57eb-b7fa-e36f8f40c1d7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186575487}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e8bf0613-dc2d-57fb-b4e9-45d51faad202" :question/math-academy-id "q-348682" :question/problem "Given that $r(t)=⟨cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi t}{2}),\\,\\frac{4}{t-1}⟩,$ what is $|r(3)|?$\n\n$|r(3)|=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Evaluating the function at $t=3,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(3) & =⟨cos\\,(\\frac{3\\pi }{2}),\\,\\frac{4}{3-1}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(3)| & =\\sqrt{{0}^{2}+{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4} \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186575595 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068857 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "d59ccd52-63db-5d28-b78b-2df7caf52ad0" :knowledge-point/title "Evaluating a Vector-Valued Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/cho